[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0010","text":"Producer先生……\n在吃什么……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0020","text":"啊，是别人送的点心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0030","text":"忙得团团转没吃上午饭\n想着先垫垫肚子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0050","text":"甜花也……\n好好工作了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0060","text":"肚子……好饿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0070","text":"……来，给你一点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0080","text":"嘿嘿……谢谢……\n我开动了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011500_02_0090","text":"…………\n好好吃……"}]
